+/*          _
+ *  __ _   (_)  ___ __ __    qjsx - JavaScript for devices
+ * / _` |  | | (_-< \ \ /    Author: Etienne Cochard + Opus 5.5
+ * \__, | _/ | /__/ /_\_\    Copyright (c) 2026 R-LIBRE INGENIERIE
